{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"Mennad went into the house.","note":"دخل منّاد المنزل."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami got back to the house.","note":"عاد سامي إلى البيت."},{"btype":"example","text":"Sami was at Layla's house today.","note":"كان سامي في بيت ليلى اليوم."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom was the only one in the house.","note":"توم كان وحده في المنزل."},{"btype":"example","text":"He didn't want to go into the house.","note":"لم يرد الدخول إلى المنزل"},{"btype":"example","text":"Do you know how to get to Tom's house?","note":"هل تعرف كيف أصل إلى منزل توم؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Mennad isn't going into Layla's house.","note":"لن يدخل منّاد منزل ليلى."},{"btype":"example","text":"Mennad didn't want to go back to that house.","note":"لم يكن منّاد يريد العودة إلى ذلك المنزل."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ziri was new.","note":"كان زيري جديدا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Are you new here?","note":"هل أنت جديد هنا؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Are you new, too?","note":"هل أنت جديد أيضاً؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"He is a new Muslim.","note":"هو مسلم جديد."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"Mennad went into the house.","ar":"دخل منّاد المنزل."},{"t":"Sami got back to the house.","ar":"عاد سامي إلى البيت."},{"t":"Sami was at L